            {
              "id": "1778463837432_sampleCIContentData",
              "name": "sampleCIContentData",
              "value": "{\"Success Stories\":{\"cols\":[\"Title\",\"Industry\",\"Customer Name\",\"Subtitle\",\"Story\",\"Main Quote\",\"Competitive Advantage\",\"Channels\"],\"rows\":[{\"cells\":[\"Fujitsu standardizes people management with Oracle Cloud HCM\",\"Business Services\",\"Fujitsu\",\"The global IT systems provider deploys Oracle Cloud HCM to unify HR systems, provide access to more data, and improve employee experiences.\",\"Fujitsu unified fragmented HR systems across global operations using Oracle Cloud HCM, improving analytics, consistency, employee experience, and operational efficiency.\",\"“The use of Oracle Cloud HCM across different business units and countries has enabled Fujitsu to start to standardize the way that we do things as an organization.” — Sarah Wadsworth, Head of HR, Fujitsu UK\",\"Oracle Cloud HCM delivered a single global HR platform with consistent employee data sharing and localized payroll integration.\",\"Email, Landing Page, Web\"]},{\"cells\":[\"Hearst transforms back office in the cloud to support growth\",\"Media\",\"Hearst\",\"Leading media company consolidates on integrated finance, inventory management, and HR application platform products.\",\"Hearst modernized disconnected finance and HR systems across 360 businesses using Oracle Cloud ERP, HCM, EPM, and SCM to improve visibility, automation, and employee productivity.\",\"“One of the things that we realized early on was that this is a different type of relationship with a software company.” — Debra Robinson, Hearst Senior Vice President and CIO\",\"Hearst adopted an integrated Oracle Cloud platform spanning ERP, EPM, HCM, SCM, and Oracle Integration to support transformation and acquisitions.\",\"Email, Landing Page, Web\"]},{\"cells\":[\"KPN fulfills its digital ambitions with Oracle Cloud Applications\",\"Communications\",\"KPN\",\"The Dutch telecom carrier’s rollout of Oracle Cloud HCM, ERP, and SCM helps it simplify and improve data sharing and decision-making across functions.\",\"KPN modernized HR, finance, and supply chain processes using Oracle Cloud Applications to reduce integrations, improve visibility, and accelerate digital transformation.\",\"“Our digital transformation started as a business transformation, which was enabled by Oracle technology.” — Tatiana Sumina, Transformation Leader\",\"Oracle Cloud HCM, ERP, SCM, and Fusion Data Intelligence Platform enabled KPN to modernize operations and improve analytics-driven decisions.\",\"Email, Landing Page, Web\"]}]}}"
            }
