          "id": "1778539418526",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778539418526_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the data in {{$context.$nodes.GET_CONTACTS.$output}}, generate a markdown\nsummary of the accounts as follows:\n\n1. Create a markdown header  (Bold text): Audience Distribution by Buying Role.\nThe markdown header font size should be 3 times of descrition and body data.\n\n2. For each buyerRole in the data, generate bullet points including:\n   - Buyer Role\n   - Total contacts\n   - Persona\n\nFormat the output clearly in markdown with appropriate headers and bullet points. Do not include any link or explaination\n\n\nUse the structure and fields from {{$context.$nodes.GET_CONTACTS.$output}} to extract\nthis information.\n\nBased on the data {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_SEGMENT_CONFIGURATION.$output.result}} show a card widget at the bottom: \n\n- subject: If {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_SEGMENT_CONFIGURATION.$output.result}} contains \"once\" or \"immediate\" then card title is \"Runs once immediately on activation\". Else generate the text for which takes data from {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_SEGMENT_CONFIGURATION.$output.result}} and convert into natural language which is human understandable and add \nafter activation\" text. This title should only display in card view and not in main title.\nExample 1: Runs every day at 2:32 PM Asia/Calcutta timezone.\nExample 2: Runs once on 22-06-2026 at 2:32 PM in the Asia/Calcutta timezone.\nExample 3: Runs weekly every 1st or on monday, tuesday, wednesday, thursday at 2:32 PM Asia/Calcutta timezone.\nExample 4: Runs monthly every 1st or on monday, tuesday, wednesday, thursday at 2:32 PM Asia/Calcutta timezone.\n\n- description: Segment schedule\n\nThese title and description should be in bottom and inside card but not in the widget.\n\nIn the bottom show card widget of oraInfoDisplay. like \n<oraInfoDisplay>\n{\n  \"patternId\": \"cardWidget\",\n  \"description\": \"Segment schedule\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"subject\": \"Runs every day at 2:32 PM Asia/Calcutta timezone after activation\",\n    \"summary\": \"Segment schedule\",\n    \"variant\": \"neutral\"\n  }\n}\n</oraInfoDisplay>\n\n**Strinctly:\nNo title in oraInfoDisplay"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 13434,
            "y": 7036
          },
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "enableActions": true,
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_CARD"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "1779159948483",
