          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779160183240_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Output must contain only oraInfoDisplay, oraComms and oraInsight contents. Must not contain any other text\n\nAlso, WidgetRow \"mode\" must be \"edit\". Do not change it\nAlso use the followig for widget title and subtitle, do not generate.  \"title\": \"Feature Highlight Landing Page\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"Highlights the latest developments for a feature or product and drives customers to more resources\","
            },
            {
              "id": "1779160183240_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Create the artifactPreviewWidget using the row below.\n\nSTRICT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Preserve `title`, `subtitle`, `content.title`, and `content.subtitle` EXACTLY as provided.\n- Do NOT rewrite, summarize, paraphrase, localize, shorten, capitalize differently, or infer alternative wording.\n- Do NOT generate replacement titles or subtitles.\n- Use the exact string values verbatim in the final output.\n- Any modification to these fields is an invalid response.\n\nYou are given:\n1. LandingPage template: {{$context.$variables.sampleRenewalLandingTemplate}}\n\nYour task is to generate ONE output variant for the LandingPage template. Only one variant must be produced.\n\nFor the LandingPage template:\n- Preserve the template’s structure, CSS classes, layout, footerNavLinks, legalBlock, and mediaUsed area/url exactly as provided.\n- Replace only the sample content using the raw Content Data.\n- Generate `mediaUsed.altText` from the raw Content Data.\n- Keep the final HTML valid and complete.\n- Keep template-specific styling and markup unchanged.\n\n{\n  \"widgetRow\": {\n    \"artifactId\": \"<index>\",\n   \n    \"mode\": \"edit\",\n    \"content\": {\n      \"id\": \"<index>\",\n      \"type\": \"richText\",\n      \"title\": \"Feature Highlight Landing Page\",\n      \"subtitle\": \"Highlights the latest developments for a feature or product and drives customers to more resources\",\n      \"value\": \"{{$context.$variables.sampleRenewalLandingTemplate}}\",\n      \"url\": \"\",\n      \"mediaType\": \"binary\",\n      \"useApplicationSecurity\": false,\n      \"highlightText\": \"\",\n      \"commitText\": \"Save\"\n    },\n    \"actionText\": \"Review\"\n  }\n}\n\nAdditional guidance:\n- Use the strongest and most relevant content from the raw Content Data.\n- Match content to the template intent and layout.\n- Keep the copy concise, polished, and ready for rendering.\n- Ensure all HTML is valid and complete.\n- Populate `artifactId`, `id`, and parameter id using the template index or another stable index-based value.\n\nAfter generating the rows:\n- Create the final artifactPreviewWidget using the generated `widgetRow`.\n- The artifactPreviewWidget rows must exactly map to the generated `widgetRow` objects.\n- Return ONLY the final artifactPreviewWidget output.\n- Do not return intermediate arrays, message properties, or explanations."
            }
          ],
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_ARTIFACT_PREVIEW"
              ],
              "enableActions": true
            }
          }
        },
