              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Evaluate the conditions in the order listed below and stop at the first matching failure condition (do not evaluate subsequent conditions once a failure is found):\n\n1. If {{$context.$nodes.PUBLISH_SEGMENT.$status}} is failure, return:\n    “We’re unable to process your request right now due to an issue that occurred during segment publish. Please try again later. If the issue persists, contact your help desk.”\n2. Else if {{$context.$nodes.ACTIVATE_TACTIC.$status}} is failure, return:\n    “We’re unable to process your request right now due to an issue that occurred during tactic publish. Please try again later. If the issue persists, contact your help desk.”\n3. Otherwise, return:\n    “We’re unable to process your request right now due to an issue that occurred during message publish. Please try again later. If the issue persists, contact your help desk.”\n\nReturn only the final response message and nothing else."
            }
